# extract-batch.env — transport override for MANUAL batch deep-extraction (template).
#
# Copy to config/extract-batch.env (gitignored) and set your batch transport. Sourced
# ONLY by scripts/run_batch_extract.sh — never by the daily launchd jobs, which stay on
# the default claude_p transport. This is how a one-off backfill uses a faster/cheaper
# model without making that the permanent process.
#
# Example: a self-hosted / provider OpenAI-compatible reasoning model (vLLM):
# DOC_EXTRACTOR_TRANSPORT=openai
# DOC_EXTRACTOR_OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://your-endpoint.example.com/v1
# DOC_EXTRACTOR_OPENAI_MODEL=Your/Model-Name
# DOC_EXTRACTOR_OPENAI_API_KEY=your-batch-endpoint-key
# DOC_EXTRACTOR_OPENAI_NO_THINK=1        # reasoning models on vLLM only
# DOC_EXTRACTOR_REPAIR_PASSES=2
